/private/var/folders/80/jm5p82hn56g0crpvv9xjzrc00000gn/T/jc2-lane.I2h68x/inputs/ideation-20260902T1608Z-sol56.md:78:Therefore equality is forced. This is the proposed **THEOREM D1-SELF-DIFFERENT** (elementary derivation here; not yet independently reviewed): every shifted root in a bottom-major disc contributes exactly `c_B`, while DETECTOR-NULL makes every maximal minor disc contribute zero. Consequently
