/private/var/folders/80/jm5p82hn56g0crpvv9xjzrc00000gn/T/jc2-lane.I2h68x/inputs/ideation-20260902T1608Z-sol56.md:135:1. **Moh endgame: raise to co-flagship.** Bound the first campaign slice as the number of realizable groups at `D=105`, an integer in `[0,264]`; do not call an all-D enumeration finite merely because depth is log-bounded.
