/Users/dc/code/math/jc2/xmodel/td12-global-source-bridge-b-fable5-hostile-review-grok46-92e-20260829.log:15:for `p=(t-A)^2(t-B)`, `q=eta(t-A)(t-B)`, `t=eta^{25}`. So the cleared landing ODE is solvable in `C[eta][1/p]` iff `8B=9A`, and on that locus the unique on-weight solution is `T = gamma q p^{-i}` with `gamma = kappa_F/(25 i lambda_f A B)`. Homogeneous deviation tops below `s*` lie in `25Z`, the greedy ledger is finite by slot count, and the reduced top cannot skip `s* = D_F+D_g-kbar_F`. Chart pieces of an actual pair are finite polynomial functionals of the pair plus a named B occurrence. `nu_F=25`, `kappa_F`, `kbar_F=17`, and the graded drop index stay distinct.
